[I] Clean book theme for scientific explanations and documentation

[T] sphinx-book-theme is a lightweight Sphinx theme designed to mimic the
[T] look and feel of an interactive book, based on the PyData Sphinx Theme
[T] and Bootstrap 5. It is used by Jupyter Book and is currently in
[T] maintenance mode.

